  "description": "Gameplay\nCrash Test Oliver offers you a sweet 2,5D platformer experience with loads of jump'n'run, different types of enemies, puzzles and big boss fights. \n\nStory\nYou are a Crash Test Dummy No. 2.409, codename \"Oliver\". Scientists are sending thousands of dummies like you into a simulation to test a baseball cap full of brand new features. None of the other test subjects have passed the simulation so far. Will you finally make a difference?Cap features\n• Punch\n\n• Stomp\n\n• Dash\n\n• Walljump\n\n• Swim",
  "description_short": "Dive into a stylized 2.5D metroidvania world. Beat enemies, find and collect items as you progress through a struggling world to finally escape the simulation. Are you ready for this journey?",
